# ─── SECRETS — never commit ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Your TopStep username + API key live here. If this hits GitHub, anyone can
# trade your account. Keep it local only; on any machine, fill in a fresh .env
# from .env.example.
.env
_env
*.env
!.env.example

# ─── Trading activity / account data — private and constantly changing ──────
choch_bot.log
bot.log
*.log
choch_trades.json
trades.json

# ─── Backtest / replay outputs — regenerated on demand, can be large ────────
choch_replay_*.json
crt_replay_*.json
choch_batch_replay_*.json
choch_daily_summary_*.xlsx
choch_trade_log_*.xlsx

# ─── Market data — too large for GitHub, and licensed (do not redistribute) ─
*.zst
*.csv
glbx-*

# ─── Python build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─── Backup files and one-off exploratory scripts (not part of the bot) ─────
*.bak
realistic_fill_estimate.py
test_limit_fill_frequency.py

